ser_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/vnd.efi.iso","state":"uploaded","size":1721292800,"digest":"sha256:589c5cc77b17f5fc305f25d4a267d792a70537ee908f7adadcaae69e1fa6be36","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-09-29T17:40:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-29T17:41:31Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/jasperaelvoet/vaporos/releases/download/v20260929.172712/vaporos-20260929.172712.iso"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasperaelvoet/vaporos/tarball/v20260929.172712","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jasperaelvoet/vaporos/zipball/v20260929.172712","body":"VaporOS 20260929.172712, built from `main` at 203c73b7e59039cd8056bc27721a7225b80e0dc9.\n\n- **Install:** write `vaporos-20260929.172712.iso` to a USB stick and boot it in UEFI mode.\n- **Update:** machines on the `main` channel pull `ghcr.io/jasperaelvoet/vaporos:main`.\n\n### Recent commits\n- 203c73b Wait for the whole replayed journal in the Sunshine client test\n- db11d41 Make the build's published files readable outside the container\n- e0d932f Count only unit starts in the start-backoff test\n- 82a9c46 Offer libraries the installer adopted to Steam once, at vosd's start\n- 623bbc9 Show held updates and why a stage stopped, storage mount and Steam registration badges, and who started a stream, offer only library filesystems for adoption, and explain that switching devices or resolution/HDR needs quitting the game in Moonlight first\n- b4354fd Record the fix wave's interfaces in docs/CONTRACTS.md (vos.disk, held updates, VOS-HEALTH, vos session launch, gamerfs, Steam library registration, the setup-code waiver and the new API fields) so the contract matches the code again\n- 33021a7 Integrate the fix wave: locked cmdline rewrites, storage runner, health serial line\n- b85e880 Harden the display manager: gamerfs for the gaming user's files, no setup code for local callers, no HDR restart under a running game, stale sessions ended, late GPUs picked up, and the shared config only through Mutate and View\n- 28ccd43 Add vos session launch, which waits for gamescope's Steam and hands it a steam:// URL in gamescope's environment\n- 35339b7 Keep keystrokes and VT switches away from tty1 while the welcome screen runs, and leave tty1 in graphics mode so the kernel console never paints over the monitors\n- a9b2d4c Bound sysd commands by their context: a pipe wait limit for every command, and a process-group kill for runuser so a stuck gamescopectl or xprop cannot hold the display lock\n- f6b54c5 Export power.WakeOnLANCapable and have the installer adopt only what the generator mounts and enable idle shutdown only when Wake-on-LAN can wake the PC\n- 6f2fd00 Mount adopted libraries nosuid,nodev, share one library filesystem rule, and add adopted libraries to Steam's library list\n- 2393ccc Start Sunshine on every boot and whenever it is down, launch games through vos session launch, and explain resumed streams\n- fe5eaa3 Record the boot disk in the installed kernel args, turn idle shutdown on only with Wake-on-LAN, keep hostname and timezone on repair, and never mount while an install runs\n"}